{
 "_readme": "Design tokens for DFX isometric assets. Every colour an asset may use is registered here. lint_asset.js fails any current asset that uses a hex not listed in __allHex. To add a colour: put it in the right group with a role note, then regenerate __allHex (the lint prints the union rule). Prefer an existing token over a new one.",
